OL,3,ARoman settlement dating back 2,000
OL,4,Ayears found under new-build estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "very significant" Roman settlement,
OL,7,Fincluding a jewellery workshop dating
OL,8,Fback nearly 2,000 years, has been found
OL,9,Funder a new-build housing estate.
OL,11,FHeneb - the trust for Welsh archaeology
OL,12,F- made the "unexpected" discovery in
OL,13,FMancot, Flintshire, amid mining surveys
OL,14,Fbeing carried out for the development
OL,15,Fand called it "one of the biggest"
OL,16,FRoman artefact collections in the
OL,17,Fcounty.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
